  "prefLabel": "He-W 842.04 Aid to the Needy Blind Categorical Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 842.04 Aid to the Needy Blind Categorical Requirements. Applicants and recipients of aid to the needy blind (ANB) medical assistance shall meet all aspects of the ANB blindness requirement in He-W 502.02 for initial and continuing eligibility.\n\nSource. #13893, eff 2-27-24",
